     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p>Hi, for Bayesian Dirichelt process misxure model, I used DP package and DPdensity().<div>DPdensity() worked well for univarate and Bivaraite but not for mulitvaraites.</div><div><br></div><div>However, I used data with 3 variables, and  it doesn&#39;t give  x1,x2 or fun1, fun2, and no dens, but calculates number of clusters.<br></div><div>So seems like it computes and  estimates number of clusters, but I see dens is NULL. So I changed the parameter for prior with three &quot;nu&quot;s like nu1, nu2, nu3. but  still comes with empty x1,x2,  fun1, fun2 and I don&#39;t think its a solution</div><div><br></div><div>So how i can build x3 or fun3 and get the list for dens? which parameters I need to change? thank you!!!</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-M_MrfF1ldgE/WRSjfjlS87I/AAAAAAAAFxk/ner4Ae2jTeEL--2Pq5WeU5ocnJbOvRIgwCLcB/s1600/DPdensity.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-M_MrfF1ldgE/WRSjfjlS87I/AAAAAAAAFxk/ner4Ae2jTeEL--2Pq5WeU5ocnJbOvRIgwCLcB/s1600/DPdensity.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466908244000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0z2PuO_0F4vy6fBZzATL8k\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-M_MrfF1ldgE/WRSjfjlS87I/AAAAAAAAFxk/ner4Ae2jTeEL--2Pq5WeU5ocnJbOvRIgwCLcB/s400/DPdensity.PNG\" border=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"238\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Yio2A6WP8_8/WRSk3aa95KI/AAAAAAAAFxw/SaWyc4RtYT4SHU68QObDPD67Ijb_7gQxwCLcB/s1600/fit_new2.PNG\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Yio2A6WP8_8/WRSk3aa95KI/AAAAAAAAFxw/SaWyc4RtYT4SHU68QObD